Description: Fix implicit int types and pointer type mismatches
 GCC 14 no longer accepts functions declared without a return type, nor
 implicit conversions between incompatible pointer types (SDL audio
 callback of the "3d" entry). The helper functions of dwitvs, which
 return nothing, are declared void, and main() returns int.
